# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run a managed workflow one time for each set of inputs, collect the results, and stay under the active job limit."
msgstr "Jalankan managed workflow sekali untuk setiap set input, kumpulkan hasilnya, dan tetap di bawah batas job aktif."

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run a parameter sweep"
msgstr "Jalankan parameter sweep"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/run-parameter-sweep.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/*\n"
"  DO NOT EDIT THIS CELL!!!\n"
"  This cell's content is generated automatically by a script. Anything you add\n"
"  here will be removed next time the notebook is run. To add new content, create\n"
"  a new cell before or after this one.\n"
"*/}\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi paket\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode di halaman ini dikembangkan dengan persyaratan berikut.\n"
"Kami menyarankan memakai versi ini atau yang lebih baru.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"A parameter sweep works like a Slurm job array. Call `run()` one time for each set of inputs, and the jobs run at the same time, each on its own node. Use the same pattern for any batch of independent inputs, such as one job for each molecule or each backend. Jobs cannot send data to each other, so split the work into independent inputs.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Parameter sweep bekerja seperti job array Slurm. Panggil `run()` sekali untuk setiap set input, dan job-job itu berjalan bersamaan, masing-masing di node-nya sendiri. Pakai pola yang sama untuk kumpulan input independen apa pun, misalnya satu job untuk setiap molekul atau setiap Backend. Job tidak bisa saling mengirim data, jadi bagi pekerjaan menjadi input yang independen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The examples on this page use the workflow from [Run a managed workflow](/guides/run-managed-workflow), which reads one angle, `theta`:\n"
msgstr "Contoh di halaman ini memakai workflow dari [Jalankan managed workflow](/guides/run-managed-workflow), yang membaca satu sudut, `theta`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start the jobs {#start-the-jobs}"
msgstr "Mulai job {#start-the-jobs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Get the workflow by its title, and call `run()` one time for each input. Save the job IDs to a file:\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr ""
"Ambil workflow berdasarkan judulnya, dan panggil `run()` sekali untuk setiap input. Simpan ID job ke file:\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Check every input first.** If the workflow has an [argument schema](/guides/managed-workflow-inputs-and-outputs#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema), call `validate_arguments()` on each input before the loop.\n"
msgstr "**Periksa setiap input lebih dulu.** Kalau workflow punya [argument schema](/guides/managed-workflow-inputs-and-outputs#best-practice-validate-arguments-with-a-schema), panggil `validate_arguments()` pada setiap input sebelum loop.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Save the job IDs to a file.** You can then collect the results from a new session.\n"
msgstr "**Simpan ID job ke file.** Dengan begitu kamu bisa mengumpulkan hasilnya dari sesi baru.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Give each run's files a unique name.** All runs share the workflow's file storage. See [Best practice: give each run's files a unique name](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows#best-practice-give-each-runs-files-a-unique-name).\n"
msgstr "**Beri nama unik untuk file setiap run.** Semua run berbagi file storage milik workflow. Lihat [Praktik terbaik: beri nama unik untuk file setiap run](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows#best-practice-give-each-runs-files-a-unique-name).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Stay under the [active job limit](#active-job-limit).** A managed workflow does not queue jobs over the limit, so when you reach it, start more jobs only after earlier jobs end.\n"
msgstr "**Tetap di bawah [batas job aktif](#active-job-limit).** Managed workflow tidak mengantrekan job yang melebihi batas, jadi saat kamu mencapainya, mulai job lagi hanya setelah job sebelumnya selesai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collect the results {#collect-the-results}"
msgstr "Kumpulkan hasil {#collect-the-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Get each job by its ID, and catch failed jobs so that one failure does not stop the loop:\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr ""
"Ambil setiap job berdasarkan ID-nya, dan tangkap job yang gagal supaya satu kegagalan tidak menghentikan loop:\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To rerun the inputs that failed, call `run()` again with the same arguments.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menjalankan ulang input yang gagal, panggil `run()` lagi dengan argumen yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Active job limit {#active-job-limit}"
msgstr "Batas job aktif {#active-job-limit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can have up to 50 jobs that are queued, initializing, running, or canceling at the same time. This limit counts all of your jobs, including jobs of other workflows. If you exceed this limit, `run()` raises a `QiskitServerlessException` and does not create or queue the job:\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa punya hingga 50 job yang sedang antre, diinisialisasi, berjalan, atau dibatalkan pada waktu yang sama. Batas ini menghitung semua job kamu, termasuk job dari workflow lain. Kalau melebihi batas ini, `run()` memunculkan `QiskitServerlessException` dan tidak membuat atau mengantrekan job:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Manage files across runs](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) to share input files between runs and give each run's files a unique name.\n"
"- [Choose a compute profile](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles) to run each job of the sweep on a size that matches its input.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"- [Kelola file lintas run](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) untuk berbagi file input antar run dan memberi nama unik pada file setiap run.\n"
"- [Pilih compute profile](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles) untuk menjalankan setiap job dalam sweep pada ukuran yang sesuai dengan inputnya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
